and-atlas/illinois/iroquois-county"],["ARC or PLC in Iroquois County","/arc-plc/illinois/iroquois-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 59% of normal in August to September and 47% of normal in September to October. Grid 24468 had its driest year in 2025 at 63%, and grid 24768 had its driest in 1963 at 60%.</p>"}
